; VU1 program 0x438: triangle-strip batch with back-face culling.
; Caller not found (no MSCAL/MSCALF 0x438 in the code; possibly in data).
; TOP+0 z (vi10) and w (vi11) choose the loop: w != 0 reflection env map (as mesh envmap_reflect), z != 0
; normal env map (as mesh envmap_add), else lit. Each vertex's winding (cross product of the last two edges,
; the sign alternating along the strip) sets ADC for back faces.

